{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56930","headline":"患目鼻人互嘲（题拟。以下嘲谑） · 佚名","name":"患目鼻人互嘲（题拟。以下嘲谑）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眼能日月盈，爲有陈根委。\n（齆人先咏侧眼人）不别似兰斯，都由鴈门紫。\n（患眼人绩下句。\n见《太平广记》卷二五七《啓颜录》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}